{
  "id": "stmt:hse:00317:c:0",
  "type": "Statement",
  "description": "The Republic of Ireland's Health Service Executive (HSE) has approved nivolumab in combination with cisplatin and pemetrexed for reimbursement as a treatment option for the neoadjuvant treatment of resectable NSCLC at high risk of recurrence in adult patients whose tumours have PD-L1 expression >= 1% (3 cycles only). The regimen further states that this combination is available in NCIS (00849.5).",
